      <abstract>
        <!-- Create an AI-friendly introductory paragraph addressing user intent.
        - Start with an objective definition of the product/feature.
        - State the technical motivation or advantage.
        - Highlight key benefits.
        If needed, add a clear list of requirements or
        prerequisites after the introductory paragraph.-->
        <para>
          &agama; is &suse;'s open source installer for &productname; &productnumber; and later
          versions. Use &agama; to manually install the product on bare-metal servers and virtual
          machines. &agama; provides an intuitive, flexible interface for installing ready-to-use
          system images and simplifies the configuration of your system during deployment.
        </para>
        <para>
          <emphasis role="bold">Prerequisites</emphasis>
        </para>
        <itemizedlist>
          <listitem>
            <para>
              A bare-metal server or virtual machine with a minimum of 1 CPU, 2 GB memory and 32 GB
              storage
            </para>
          </listitem>
          <listitem>
            <para>
              An Agama-based ISO image file of &productname;
            </para>
          </listitem>
          <listitem>
            <para>
              An active registration code for &productname; from the &scc;
            </para>
          </listitem>
        </itemizedlist>
